\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE: Philippine  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  To Review BOP Target As Jan Surplus Surges\b0\par\par\uc2 436 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Februar 2013\par 10:52\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 --\b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to review BOP surplus target\par \par \uc2 --BOP surplus in January at $2.043 billion, more than triple December surplus\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     By Rhea Sandique-Carlos \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 MANILA-\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Philippines\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ' \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets and a surge in income from its investments abroad swelled the country's balance of payments surplus in January and may prompt a revision of the bank's forecasts.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bangko Sentral ng Pilipinas\f28 \uc2 \f2  Tuesday said January's BOP surplus was $2.043 billion, more than triple the $640 million surplus registered in December 2012 and well above the $864 million surplus in January 2012.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The substantial increase in January's surplus was mostly supported by the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  as well as income from investments abroad, said BSP Governor \f28 \uc2 \f2 Amando Tetangco\f28 \uc2 \f2  .\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has been \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market to keep the peso from appreciating sharply. Despite the bank's support of the dollar, the peso appreciated 6.4% against the greenback in 2012. That \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has led to a buildup in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Philippines\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ' \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves and those reserves are mostly parked in U.S. Treasurys, providing income for the BSP.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The government is planning to revisit its projection for a BOP surplus of $3 billion for 2013, Mr. Tetangco said. When the forecast was made last year, "the expectation was that, among others, the country will have a larger trade deficit, as imports will recover, in line with a recovery in the export market, given the expected improvement in the external environment," he said.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "If the \f28 \uc2 \f2 EU\f28 \uc2 \f2  recovers as \f28 \uc2 \f2 the ECB\f28 \uc2 \f2  [\f28 \uc2 \f2 European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  ] anticipates, and if the U.S. economy remains on track, we should see some easing in the capital inflows," Mr. Tetangco added.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 One of the factors for the peso's strength over the last year has been capital inflows as investors look for higher returns amid near-zero interest rates in developed nations.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "The desire [of the BSP] is not to manipulate but to temper the strengthening of the peso," said \f28 \uc2 \f2 Emilio Neri\f28 \uc2 \f2  , an economist with \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank of the Philippine Islands\f28 \uc2 \f2  . He added that if capital inflows continue, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  may need to further \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets and keep the peso from appreciating more substantially.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Mr. Neri expects the BOP surplus this year to range between $10 billion-$11 billion.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The country had a BOP surplus of $9.236 billion in 2012, compared with $10.179 billion the previous year.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Write to Rhea Sandique-Carlos at rhea.sandique-carlos@dowjones.com [ 19-02-13 0952GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130219e92j000ev\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
