\par\par \b \uc2 Philippine Ctrl Bk: Scope For Occasional  \highlight22\uc2 FX Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 287 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 September 2005\par 09:56\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 MANILA (Dow Jones--The \b \highlight22\uc2 Philippines\b0 \highlight\uc2 ' \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  won't hesitate to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market if a weakening peso is seen pushing inflation sharply higher.  \par \par \uc2 The peso has been under pressure the past several weeks on political concerns and worries over the economic impact of high world oil prices.  \par \par \uc2 "The Bangko Sentral ng Pilipinas will maintain a market-determined exchange rate with scope for occasional official action in cases where extreme movement in the peso threatens the inflation target," \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Amando Tetangco told a midyear economic briefing Monday.  \par \par \uc2 Tools used by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to quell volatility on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market include raising key overnight rates, adjusting commercial banks' reserve requirement or directly buying or selling dollars on the Philippine Dealing System.  \par \par \uc2 At the last monthly rate-setting meeting of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's policy-making Monetary Board held two weeks ago, key overnight borrowing and lending rates were left unchanged at 7.00% and 9.25%, respectively.  \par \par \uc2 That time, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it wanted to ensure adequate liquidity to fuel economic activity. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also said domestic inflationary pressures were driven by supply factors, particularly rising oil prices, thus policy tightening wasn't merited.  \par \par \uc2 Tetangco said last month that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  expects the inflation rate for August to range between 6.6% and 7.1% on year compared with the previous month's 7.1% amid a slower increase in food prices.  \par \par \uc2 In afternoon trade, the dollar averaged PHP56.121 compared with Friday's close of PHP56.10.  \par \par \uc2 -By Ditas Lopez, Dow Jones Newswires; (632) 848-5051; ditas.lopez@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Genevieve Soledad [ 05-09-05 0756GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020050905e195000c5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
