driven by supply factors, particularly rising oil prices, thus policy tightening wasn't merited.  \par \par \uc2 Tetangco said last month that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  expects the inflation rate for August to range between 6.6% and 7.1% on year compared with the previous month's 7.1% amid a slower increase in food prices.  \par \par \uc2 In afternoon trade, the dollar averaged PHP56.121 compared with Friday's close of PHP56.10. -By Ditas Lopez, Dow Jones Newswires; (632) 848-5051; ditas.lopez@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Genevieve Soledad  \par \par \uc2 -0-  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJCFWE0020050905e195007hi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
