\par\par \b \uc2 Philippine Ctrl Bk: Peso Undermined By Non-Econ Factors  \b0\par\par\uc2 251 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Juni 2005\par 07:00\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 MANILA (Dow Jones)--The monetary authorities of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Philippines\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't appear to see any immediate need to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Tuesday, even as the peso teetered close to its lowest level against the U.S. dollar.  \par \par \uc2 "The peso is reacting to non-economic factors," acting Bangko Sentral ng Pilipinas Governor Amando Tetangco told Dow Jones Newswires in a text message. "Based on macroeconomic fundamentals, it should be trading better."  \par \par \uc2 He refused to respond to questions about whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 , saying only: "We continue to monitor the market."  \par \par \uc2 At the noon break Tuesday, an hour before a congressional hearing on the alleged wiretap recordings purporting to show President Gloria Arroyo conspired to rig last year's elections, the U.S. dollar averaged PHP55.88, higher than its PHP55.745 close Monday.  \par \par \uc2 The dollar spiked to an intraday high of PHP55.94, just a few fluctuations away from its record high of PHP56.45 on March 22, 2004, shortly before the elections.  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders don't seem to see the need for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to step in, even as the dollar extended its gains to a ninth straight day Tuesday.  \par \par \uc2 "The dollar has reached crazy levels already," said one trader, even though the peso had started to recoup some losses before the noon break.  \par \par \uc2 -By Cris Larano, Dow Jones Newswires; 632-885-0288; cris.larano@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Paul Baylis [ 21-06-05 0530GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020050621e16l00040\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
